  "question": {
    "text": "Using molecular orbital theory predict the correct decreasing bond order of the following species&nbsp;<br />\r<math><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mi></mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mi></mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mi></mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mi></mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "WtoKj",
      "text": "1 &gt; 2 &gt; 3 &gt; 4",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
